Z||000000||My7Fieros||12-13-2001||09:16 PM||||No big deal, and alot of you prob already knew this (but I didnt)......<BR>If you want something to come up in another window, say, for example, you click on the Totally Off Topic section of the forum, hold down the 'shift' key while you click on it, instead of the whole screen going to that section, the O/T section will pop up over the main forum page in another window...just a neat little trick I learned. Like I said Im sure alot of you already knew that, but I just learned it and thought I'd pass it along for those of you who didnt. (Thank you Tech TV!)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Try it out||||reg||7
Z||000001||watts||12-13-2001||09:19 PM||||Or right click on the link and hit 'open in new window'.<BR>||||reg||1
